"surface":"ஏமம்சால்","parts":[{"text":"ஏமம்","lemma":"ஏமம்","gloss":"protection"},{"text":"சால்","lemma":"சால்","gloss":"abundant"}],"gloss":"abundantly protective"},{"surface":"சிறப்பின்","parts":[{"text":"சிறப்பு","lemma":"சிறப்பு","gloss":"excellence"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of excellence"},{"surface":"இ","parts":[{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"this"}],"gloss":"this"},{"surface":"பணைநல்","parts":[{"text":"பணை","lemma":"பணை","gloss":"fertile field"},{"text":"நல்","lemma":"நல்","gloss":"good"}],"gloss":"fertile and good"},{"surface":"ஊரே","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"town"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"town indeed"}]}],"literal":"Elephants with thick legs and sounding bells on their sides, / Chariots with swaying banners on top, and horses, / Thronging with warriors fitted with weapons, making a loud clamor, / A wide army like seeing the ocean, / Kings with drums beaten in victory, always, / Like the victory of the generous-handed Eyinan at Vāgai, / Will not remain quiet without obtaining this woman's beauty. / What indeed will happen to / The red-streaked heron that fed in the clear-water pond, / If it gets tired of the flowery branches of the sweet marutam tree, / Sleeps on the desirable Kāñci tree, / This fertile, good town of abundant, protective excellence?","translation":"Kings with wide armies that look like the ocean, filled with thick-legged elephants wearing sounding bells, chariots with swaying banners, horses, and well-armed warriors making a loud clamor, will never rest without winning this girl's beauty, just like the victory of the generous-handed Eyinan at Vāgai. What will happen to this beautiful, fertile town of great excellence and safety, where the red-streaked heron, having fed in the clear-water pond, gets tired of the flowery branches of the sweet marutam tree and goes to sleep on the lovely Kāñci tree?","modern":"ஒலிக்கும் மணிகளைப் பக்கங்களில் கட்டிய பருத்த கால்களைக் கொண்ட யானைகளும், கொடிகள் அசையும் தேர்களும், குதிரைகளும், ஆயுதங்கள் ஏந்திய வீரர்களும் நிறைந்து கடல் போலப் பரந்திருக்கும் சேனைகளைக் கொண்ட அரசர்கள், கொடைவள்ளல் எயினன் வாகைப் போர்க்களத்தில் பெற்ற வெற்றியைப் போல, இவளுடைய அழகைப் பெறாமல் சும்மா இருக்க மாட்டார்கள். தெளிந்த நீரையுடைய பொய்கையில் இரையைத் தேடி உண்ட சிவந்த வரிகளையுடைய நாரை, தேன் நிறைந்த மருத மரத்தின் பூக்களையுடைய கிளையை வெறுத்து, அழகான காஞ்சி மரத்தில் உறங்கும் பாதுகாப்பு மிக்க சிறப்பையுடைய இந்த வளமான நல்லூருக்கு இனி என்ன நேருமோ?","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Makaṭpāṟ Kāñci theme, where a father refuses to give his daughter in marriage to powerful kings, leading to a siege of the town. The poet describes the massive, ocean-like armies of the kings who are determined to win the girl's beauty, comparing their resolve to the famous battle of Eyinan at Vāgai. In contrast to this impending violence, the poet paints a peaceful picture of the town's fertile landscape, where a red-streaked heron feeds in a clear pond, gets bored of the sweet marutam tree, and sleeps on a lovely Kāñci tree. This beautiful, secure town is now on the brink of destruction because of the kings' desire. The contrast between the peaceful nature of the town and the clamor of the invading armies heightens the tragedy of the situation.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.4],[1.4,1.6],[1.6,1.8],[1.8,3.0],[3.0,3.4],[3.4,3.7],[3.7,4.2],[4.2,5.4],[5.4,5.52],[5.64,5.7],[5.7,5.7],[5.7,7.9],[7.9,8.0],[8.0,8.3],[8.3,8.9],[8.9,10.5],[10.5,10.6],[10.6,11.0],[11.0,11.6],[11.6,12.4],[12.49,12.75],[12.75,13.1],[13.1,13.5],[13.5,14.7],[14.7,15.2],[15.2,15.6],[15.6,16.0],[16.0,16.42],[16.7,16.9],[16.9,17.2],[17.2,17.9],[18.56,19.06],[19.06,19.26],[19.26,19.66],[19.66,19.96],[19.96,20.56],[20.56,21.06],[21.06,21.16],[21.16,21.66],[21.66,22.86],[22.86,23.06],[23.06,23.46],[23.46,24.56],[24.56,24.96],[24.96,25.26],[25.26,25.56],[25.56,25.86]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.4],[1.4,1.6],[1.6,1.8],[1.8,3.3],[3.3,3.7]